


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_ddbfddba:



    voice "2SA_0816"
    sachiko "「Trick or Chocolate！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_0026652c:


    "在敲门之前，管理人房间里就跑出了一只生剥鬼。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_9c676bae:



    voice "2HI_1187"
    hina "「呜哇，还来啊，这个人……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_99c92bfc:



    voice "2RI_1230"
    rin "「又是这样混杂着各种元素。还有就是，跟上次节分时一样，为什么是鬼在等着啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_25ec7b99:



    voice "2SA_0817"
    sachiko "「不给巧克力就捣乱！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_19e978a7:



    voice "2HI_1188"
    hina "「不是一直都在捣乱么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_6e6da36a:



    voice "2FU_0937"
    fumi "「不可以等到白色情人节再回礼么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_e0774a74:



    voice "2SA_0818"
    sachiko "「呜呜呜呜呜呜！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_21dfc13c:


    rin_fumi "「居然撒起娇来了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_c85cd606:



    voice "2HI_1189"
    hina "「嗯？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_d448e1a5:



    voice "2RI_1232"
    rin "「好了好了快把这个脱了，不然就用巧克力扔你了哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_08881218:



    voice "2SA_0819"
    sachiko "「唔唔唔……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_bbc6858f:



    voice "2FU_0939"
    fumi "「其实我们早就准备好了。正准备送过来的」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_8ff5ea82:


    "文把装有四人的巧克力的袋子交给祥子。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_e1dd4a13:



    voice "2SA_0820"
    sachiko "「哇啊啊啊啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_8a5cd52c:


    "像是得到了稀有装备般，祥子举起了袋子。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_363c9921:



    voice "2RI_1233"
    rin "「……好蠢啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_892731b9:



    voice "2SA_0821"
    sachiko "「这叫仪式感」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_a_3ba34689:


    "结束了巧克力的讨要后，四人回到了房间。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_a_89a8e0bf:



    voice "2SA_0822"
    sachiko "「谢谢～」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_a_e7d92104:



    voice "2MI_0985"
    miyako "「啊，对了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_a_5ae81cfe:


    "离去的时候，圣夜子回过头来。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_a_6ad81b2a:



    voice "2SA_0823"
    sachiko "「嗯？怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_a_d64b79b2:



    voice "2MI_0986"
    miyako "「那个，有收到过本命的么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_a_3ee4f006:



    voice "2SA_0824"
    sachiko "「当然有收到过啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_a_fc683f4b:


    "出乎意料的瞬时回答。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_a_42b23af8:



    voice "2MI_0987"
    miyako "「……诶？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_a_5c0aedc3:



    voice "2SA_0825"
    sachiko "「可爱的女孩子我都喜欢♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_a_bf352538:



    voice "2MI_0988"
    miyako "「哈哈，确实是这样呢……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_a_90dd6f3d:


    "圣夜子苦笑着，尝试追上先走的三人。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_a_0fd4d656:


    "…………"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_a_0c4ab980:


    "祥子目送着她们离去，自言自语道。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_a_6d26af6a:



    voice "2SA_0826"
    sachiko "「……有啊。她和你很像」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_b_b2492495:



    voice "2SA_0827"
    sachiko "「……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_b_8554e722:


    "在大家欢快的笑声中，祥子看见已经离了有些距离的圣夜子停了下来。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_b_8f2206db:



    voice "2MI_0989"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_b_bc948950:


    "有些尴尬的对视，圣夜子向祥子摇摇头，微微地笑了笑。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_b_54979c07:



    voice "2FU_0940"
    fumi "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_comn_03_b_b7cf3201:


    "文发现后碰了碰圣夜子的背。"
